---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { REMOVAL_ADDRESS } from "../lib/launch.ts";
---

<Base>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-3">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-8">
      The Rupee Fund is a programme of the FOSS United Foundation. The fund adopts the <a
        href="https://fossunited.org/privacy-policy"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-link">FOSS United privacy policy</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">What we collect</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-4 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
      <li>Your name.</li>
      <li>Your email address.</li>
      <li>The time of your consent.</li>
      <li>The page that you used to join.</li>
      <li>The amount each month that you say you can give.</li>
      <li>The number of months that you say you can give, if you answer.</li>
      <li>The question that you ask the team, if you ask one.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
      We keep this data to send you one email when the fund opens, and to plan the fund. Your
      answers about money bind you to nothing. We take no payment. We hold no payment details. The
      team alone reads your answers.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">Your IP address</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
      We read your IP address when you send the form. We use it to prevent abuse. When your browser
      runs JavaScript, we also send it to Cloudflare with the bot check below. We do not keep it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">Bot protection</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
      When your browser runs JavaScript, the form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to tell a person apart
      from a bot. Cloudflare states what Turnstile collects in the <a
        href="https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-link">Turnstile Privacy Addendum</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">Fonts</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-6">
      Each page loads fonts from <a
        href="https://fonts.google.com"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-link">Google Fonts</a
      >. Google receives your IP address.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">How to leave the list</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mb-8">
      Send an email to <a href={`mailto:${REMOVAL_ADDRESS}`} class="inline-link"
        >{REMOVAL_ADDRESS}</a
      >. We take you off the list. We keep your entry, and we mark it as removed, so that a later
      signup cannot add you again. Ask at any time.
    </p>

    <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Back to home</a>
  </div>
</Base>
